        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "12. In Smt. Icchu Devi Choraria Vs. Union of India & Ors. (AIR 1980 SC 1983), the Apex Court has observed as :-\n\"The court has always regarded personal liberty as the most precious possession of mankind and refused to tolerate illegal deten"
      },
